msgid "BASIC_ARRANGEMENT_HELP"
msgstr "Start here for suggested strings and frets, favoring the lower frets near the headstock. Check the note count and warnings below: some notes cannot be placed, and displayed chords are not guaranteed comfortable."

msgid "PICK_ARRANGEMENT_HELP"
msgstr "This makes a separate, pick-friendly tab. A bracket marks the strings to strum. X means touch that string lightly so it does not ring. For crowded chords, the tab may leave out notes; the staff and playback still keep the original music."

msgid "PICK_COVERAGE"
