msgid "PICK_LIMIT"
msgstr "Procedural preview: each chord shape can be swept across one continuous string range. This has not been reviewed by a guitar teacher. Source pitches, timing, staff notation and audio are unchanged."

msgid "PICK_OMITTED"
msgstr "△ %d source notes are left out of the pick-friendly tab where the full chord cannot fit. They remain visible on the staff and audible."

msgid "FINGER_ARRANGEMENT_HELP"
msgstr "This makes a separate fingerpicking tab. T means thumb; I, M, and R mean index, middle, and ring fingers. One finger is suggested per sounding string. Crowded chords may leave out notes; the staff and playback still keep the original music."

msgid "FINGER_COVERAGE"
msgstr "Fingerpicking tab: %d of %d source notes included"

msgid "FINGER_LIMIT"
msgstr "Generated suggestion: notes that start together use up to four picking fingers. They are not spread into a sequence. This has not been reviewed by a guitar teacher. Source pitches, timing, staff notation and audio are unchanged."

msgid "FINGER_OMITTED"
msgstr "△ %d source notes are left out of the fingerpicking tab where the full chord cannot fit. They remain visible on the staff and audible."

msgid "BARRE_FOUND"
