msgid "TEMPO_HELP"
msgstr "Tempo is how fast the music moves. 100% is the original speed; 50% is half speed. BPM means beats per minute: 60 is one beat per second. Here, a beat is a quarter note. Changing speed keeps the same pitches; later tempo changes keep their proportions."

